---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-mint via-white to-mint py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="profile-cta-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6" data-reveal data-reveal-variant="scale">
    <h2 id="profile-cta-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-4xl">
      Siap Bermitra dengan <span class="highlight-underline">{site.name}</span>?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-body">
      Diskusikan kebutuhan digital Anda dengan tim kami. Konsultasi awal gratis untuk membantu memetakan solusi
      terbaik bagi organisasi Anda.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/#kontak"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-teal px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-teal/20 transition hover:bg-teal/90 hover:scale-105"
      >
        Jadwalkan Konsultasi
      </a>
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-teal/20 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-teal transition hover:bg-mint"
      >
        Kembali ke Beranda <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
